# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong: "You may cast that card" - a land is never cast (CR 305.9, 601.2), so with a land on top
# of the library the trigger looks at it and asks nothing. Bot1 puts the Planetarium out on turn 1 with Sol Ring, Black
# Lotus and Mox Jet, activates it with Mox Pearl and scries 2, keeping Island on top and putting Counterspell on the
# bottom. The trigger looks at the Island (`Bot1.Looked`) and no "may cast" is asked (`! Bot1.Accept`; the scenarios in
# which a nonland card is on top are asked). The Island stays on top.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong
Mox Pearl
Island
Island
Counterspell
Misshapen Fiend x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

